text Naranja_IslaNavel_G00_M13_Text_0816C941 {
    "Have you already challenged FLANNERY,\nthe LEADER of LAVARIDGE GYM?\pThe girl’s grandfather was famous.\nHe was one of the ELITE FOUR in the\lPOKéMON LEAGUE at one point.\pIt wouldn’t surprise me to see FLANNERY\nbecome a great TRAINER in her own\lright."
}

text Naranja_IslaNavel_G00_M13_Text_0816CA39 {
    "POKéMON CONTESTS\nSUPER RANK REGISTRATION\p“Burst on to the POKéMON scene!”"
}

text Naranja_IslaNavel_G00_M13_Text_081925E1 {
    "My big brother’s the FOSSIL MANIAC...\nHe’s a nice guy who loves fossils...\pHe loves digging holes, too...\nHe dug this hole by himself...\pYou can have this, so you can DIG\nholes just like my big brother..."
}

text Naranja_IslaNavel_G00_M13_Text_081926AE {
    "If you make a POKéMON DIG inside a\ncave, you’re returned to the entrance..."
}

text Naranja_IslaNavel_G00_M13_Text_086B54BD {
    "Cste es el gimnasio de NAVEL…\pLa subida parece que será dura\nmejor empezar cuanto antes…"
}

text Naranja_IslaNavel_G00_M13_Text_086B54DB {
    "La subida parece que será dura\nmejor empezar cuanto antes…"
}

text Naranja_IslaNavel_G00_M13_Text_086B5516 {
    "…pero no corras tanto    \nte fatigarás.\pY aún queda una larga escalada."
}

text Naranja_IslaNavel_G00_M13_Text_086B8005 {
    "¡Horrible! ¡Eres lent{RIVAL} y torpe!\n¡Te juro que me das vergüenza ajena!\pNo sé ni que hacer…\pHagamos como que esto nunca sucedió\ny como si yo no te conociera."
}

text Naranja_IslaNavel_G00_M13_Text_086B8C07 {
    "¿Y cómo surfearé?"
}
